<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
 	The FW20 Hyperlight Vest and Jacket have been re-fit to be roomier through the hip and shoulder areas in comparison to our FW19 Hyperlight styles. We increased the amount of fill pumped into the jacket by 20% to make what we believe is the warmest down quilted fill jacket in its price range. Both vest and jacket have zippered front hand pockets and all down styles this season have been finished with black YKK zips and custom zip pulls. All down products this season have been branded with an interior vintage damask label celebrating our Adsum Mountain Works design pack artwork. 
  </p>
