<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    New to the FW20 assortment is the high pile fleece lined Hampton Jacket. There are minimal exterior embellishments except for dual reverse entry wide plackets that cover metal YKK zippered hand pockets and a tonal logo embroidery. Covering the the interior sherpa lining is an Italian peached nylon blend weather cloth which is both wind and water resistant. Having cotton fibers spun into the yarn composition of the exterior fabric gives the fabric an incredible hand feel and allows for micro peaching finishing.  
  </p>
</div>

<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 11px; color: grey; line-height: 16px; text-align: center;">
    Model is 6'3" and 170 lbs. He wears size Large for Jackets/Vests and size Medium for bottoms.
  </p>
